## Why This Is Asked
This question tests cross-process IPC, privacy-preserving on-device ML, and production-minded governance. It requires a concrete IPC surface, encrypted storage, opt-in controls, and a comprehensive plan for updates and testing.

## Key Concepts
- Android isolated process and AIDL IPC for secure communication
- Encryption at rest using Android Keystore with AES-256
- Encrypted Room storage for inputs and model state
- On-device ML with TensorFlow Lite
- Update orchestration under Doze, Wi-Fi/charging constraints with rollback support

